// a project: Greet.hproj gives the switch values (Times is overridden by the test's own --times 3),
// and Shout.haste beside it is a module of the project
switch Name = "world"
switch Times = 1 where it > 0
for i in 1..Times
  print(Shout.Loud("hello {Name}"))
end
// args: --times 3
// out: HELLO MARK DAY!
// out: HELLO MARK DAY!
// out: HELLO MARK DAY!
